RULE receiving server cancel request (requires org.jboss.byteman.debug property)
CLASS org.jboss.ejb.protocol.remote.EJBClientChannel$MethodInvocation
METHOD handleResponse
AT INVOKE org.jboss.ejb.client.EJBReceiverInvocationContext.requestCancelled
IF TRUE
DO
    debug("received cancel response from server")
ENDRULE

RULE receiving local cancel request
CLASS org.jboss.ejb.client.EJBClientInvocationContext$FutureResponse
METHOD cancel
AFTER INVOKE cancelInvocation
IF TRUE
DO
    (new Exception("invocation is being cancelled locally")).printStackTrace()
ENDRULE